    "label": "thm:lowerbound",
    "number": "Theorem 1",
    "quote": "Let $n\\geq 2$ and assume all agents are truthful. Let the \\valueregret{} $\\RmaxT$ be as defined in~\\eqref{eqn:regret}. Then, for $T\\geq 128 n$, \\[ \\inf_\\Acal \\sup_\\Theta \\;\\EE\\left[\\RmaxT\\right] \\geq\\, \\frac{1}{50} (n-1)^{4/3} T^{2/3}. \\]"
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Minimax lower bound on VCG regret (not a standard bandit regret), so quantity=other."
  },
